WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:13.221 --> 00:00:16.516
Dad, time to get up!

00:00:20.478 --> 00:00:22.731
Wake up!

00:00:28.278 --> 00:00:29.863
Sorry, I overslept again.

00:00:29.946 --> 00:00:31.781
I've got to bring a box lunch today.

00:00:32.282 --> 00:00:34.159
I totally forgot about it.

00:00:34.784 --> 00:00:37.370
It's all right.
I've made something for all of us.

00:00:37.454 --> 00:00:39.080
-It's burning.
-Let me do it.

00:00:42.208 --> 00:00:43.877
Here, this is yours, Mei.

00:00:45.003 --> 00:00:46.254
It's for me!

00:00:47.088 --> 00:00:48.590
Mei, sit down and eat!

00:00:48.923 --> 00:00:49.799
Okay.

00:00:51.342 --> 00:00:53.094
Here, wrap yours.

00:00:56.222 --> 00:00:58.808
Satsuki!

00:00:59.225 --> 00:01:03.104
Uh-oh. I'm coming!

00:01:04.814 --> 00:01:06.524
You made a friend already?

00:01:06.608 --> 00:01:08.526
She's calling you!

00:01:09.110 --> 00:01:10.570
Yeah, that's Michiko.

00:01:12.989 --> 00:01:14.407
Gotta go!

00:01:16.117 --> 00:01:17.410
See you!

00:01:18.036 --> 00:01:19.788
Have a good day!

00:01:21.289 --> 00:01:22.582
Morning!

00:01:22.665 --> 00:01:24.709
Hi, let's go.

00:01:25.919 --> 00:01:27.879
-Hi!
-Good morning!

